<title>FINLAND: FINNISH 2006 BOND YIELDS 6.45 PCT AT AUCTION.</title>
<headline>FINNISH 2006 BOND YIELDS 6.45 PCT AT AUCTION.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue of the S1/96</p>
<p>bond was announced by the State Treasury Office.</p>
<p> ISSUER:				 Republic of Finland</p>
<p> MATURITY:			     18-04-2006</p>
<p> COUPON:				 7.25 PCT</p>
<p> AUCTION YIELD:			6.45 PCT</p>
<p> PRICE:				  105.45</p>
<p> AUCTION AMOUNT			FIM 1,121 MLN</p>
<p> BID AMOUNT:			   FIM 1,251 MLN</p>
<p> PAYMENT FREQUENCY:		  YEARLY</p>
<p>NOTES: The previous auction of the bond raised 1.50 billion markka at a price of 105.70 and a yield of 6.42 percent. After today's auction, the outstanding amount is 16.64 billion markka.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-0-6805 0245</p>
